,"videos":[{"id":"tt0281474:1:1","season":1,"episode":1,"title":"Guerra de salchichas","overview":"Cuando el Pájaro Loco compra un carrito de hot dogs, él y Pablo Morsa, el vendedor al otro lado de la calle, empiezan a competir entre ellos y crean una mezcla de hot dogs que atrae la atención de un adinerado hombre de negocios.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lM7kiO20DQenpXg7xMQBrlQt38D.jpg","released":"1999-05-08T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"7 min"},{"id":"tt0281474:1:2","season":1,"episode":2,"title":"Chilly eléctrico","overview":"¡Smedley es víctima de una televisión que se vuelve loca!","released":"1999-05-08T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"7 min"},{"id":"tt0281474:1:3","season":1,"episode":3,"title":"El Pájaro Loco y la termita","overview":"Mother Nature says Woody's behind his pecking days so Woody hires a termite to do his job. This soon backfires when the termite decides to do mischief.","released":"1999-05-08T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"7 min"},{"id":"tt0281474:1:4","season":1,"episode":4,"title":"Vacaciones falsas","overview":"Buzz Buzzard attempts to fool Woody by making a fake vacation where Woody would see hola-fraus. However, Woody then reports him for a scam for trying to steal his cash.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4yeqzAmbP3NZ2PTT6PyFTzNeVkI.jpg","released":"1999-05-15T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"7 min"},{"id":"tt0281474:1:5","season":1,"episode":5,"title":"La doctora Winnie","overview":"Winnie se va a ver al Dr. Nutts para aprender cómo puede entrar en el campo de la medicina.","released":"1999-05-15T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"7 min"},{"id":"tt0281474:1:6","season":1,"episode":6,"title":"Super cable","overview":"Después de que el Pájaro Loco intenta robar la señal de televisión por cable de Pablo Morsa para ver los Juegos de las Tierras Altas de Escocia, termina en prisión, donde el único juego que se juega es \"¿Qué estás viendo fijamente?\".","released":"1999-05-15T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"7 min"},{"id":"tt0281474:1:7","season":1,"episode":7,"title":"Qué temperamento","overview":"El Pájaro Loco hace todo lo posible para sacar de quicio a la señorita Meany, quien está trabajando con un doctor para mejorar su problema de temperamento.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ftdkl0gm47qB2z6NG4tyWFf11b0.jpg","released":"1999-05-22T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"7 min"},{"id":"tt0281474:1:8","season":1,"episode":8,"title":"La leyenda del duérmete niño","overview":"Un viejo pescador relata la leyenda del duérmete niño, la historia de un oso polar que puede ser escuchado a la distancia cantando una canción de cuna en la copa de un árbol.","released":"1999-05-22T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"7 min"},{"id":"tt0281474:1:9","season":1,"episode":9,"title":"Curso de aviación","released":"1999-05-22T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"7 min"},{"id":"tt0281474:1:10","season":1,"episode":10,"title":"Woody's Ship of Ghouls","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/513orWy4226FRFYChu03zUfC7vc.jpg","released":"1999-05-29T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"7 min"},{"id":"tt0281474:1:11","season":1,"episode":11,"title":"Bad Hair Day","released":"1999-05-29T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"7 min"},{"id":"tt0281474:1:12","season":1,"episode":12,"title":"Downsized Woody","released":"1999-05-29T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"7 min"},{"id":"tt0281474:1:13","season":1,"episode":13,"title":"Ya Gonna Eat That?","released":"1999-06-05T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"7 min"},{"id":"tt0281474:1:14","season":1,"episode":14,"title":"Chilly & Hungry","released":"1999-06-05T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"7 min"},{"id":"tt0281474:1:15","season":1,"episode":15,"title":"Brother Cockroach","released":"1999-06-05T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"7 min"},{"id":"tt0281474:1:16","season":1,"episode":16,"title":"Father's Day","released":"1999-06-12T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"7 min"},{"id":"tt0281474:1:17","season":1,"episode":17,"title":"Camp Buzzard","released":"1999-06-12T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"7 min"},{"id":"tt0281474:1:18","season":1,"episode":18,"title":"He Wouldn't Woody","